{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Chaotic Party Where You Rewrite the Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PiPu Party</strong> is a 2-8 player co-op puzzle action game where <strong>you rewrite the level in real-time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/5cccfe2b017c9936277469f0be879fc6.poster.avif?t=1772958296\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/5cccfe2b017c9936277469f0be879fc6.webm?t=1772958296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/5cccfe2b017c9936277469f0be879fc6.mp4?t=1772958296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shared Backpack. Shared Chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Puzzles (2 Players):</strong> Team up and combine your symbols to solve challenges. Think together, communicate, and reach the goal\u2014or fail hilariously trying. That &quot;Aha!&quot; moment is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/05235db2e07986ac6c56c16e0acbc60b.poster.avif?t=1772958296\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/05235db2e07986ac6c56c16e0acbc60b.webm?t=1772958296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/05235db2e07986ac6c56c16e0acbc60b.mp4?t=1772958296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Work Together. Or Sabotage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Mayhem (2-8 Players):</strong> Race to the finish by any means necessary. Use symbols to help yourself\u2014or place a clever trap for the friend who's about to win. Expect  <strong>Pure &amp; Joyful Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/724914cc938608d21ec2e8b61da366b5.poster.avif?t=1772958296\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/724914cc938608d21ec2e8b61da366b5.webm?t=1772958296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/extras/724914cc938608d21ec2e8b61da366b5.mp4?t=1772958296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078600?t=1772958296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078600?t=1772958296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/241e9dbe6b5b8a20850eefcb4b27571c71430798/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772958296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078600/241e9dbe6b5b8a20850eefcb4b27571c71430798/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772958296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"